  "docs.intro": "This system is an AI gateway that routes client requests across multiple providers and models with automatic failover and load balancing. Clients are authenticated with the X-Client-Code and X-Client-Secret headers. Requests are submitted in one of two modes: specific (a fixed model) or general (automatic provider selection). The result is returned synchronously (sync) or asynchronously (async with callback/polling).",
