  "docs.example.general": "Send example (general):",
  "docs.note.async": "For async mode set async: true, then poll the status and result actions. If you provide a callback_url, the ACK and the final result are posted to it.",
  "docs.note.security": "Security: always use HTTPS; provider API keys are added only from the admin panel and are stored encrypted (AES-256-CBC) in the database.",

